From 8b75d6cb1eaf6db0fc0d1bb64ed4970c036d2814 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roqqit <roqqit@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 12 Jun 2024 22:27:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Set BIP16 activation height to 0 (always active)

Maintenance explanation (added 2026-10-14; not original author text):
Match Dogecoin P2SH enforcement from height zero instead of inherited ABC
activation settings. Full historical-chain verification remains outstanding.

The original subject, author and author date are preserved. Only message
metadata changes; exact source diff bytes and intermediate trees are retained.

